<title>USA: Oklahoma Water repriced, ylds 5.10 pct in 2016.</title>
<headline>Oklahoma Water repriced, ylds 5.10 pct in 2016.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>PaineWebber Inc. said Tuesday it repriced Oklahoma Water Resources Board $1.9 million deal. At the repricing the top yield was 5.10 percent in 2016.</p>
<p>The repricing follows:</p>
<p>OKLAHOMA WATER RESOURCES BOARD</p>
<p>RE: $1,900,000*</p>
<p>STATE LOAN PROGRAM REVENUE BONDS, SERIES 1995</p>
<p>(CONVERTED SERIES 1997B)</p>
<p>PLEASE NOTE REPRICING IN 2016 MATURITY.</p>
<p>    MOODY'S: NA		    S&amp;P: AA</p>
<p>						(CONFIRMED)</p>
<p>    DATED: 10/18/1995	    FIRST COUPON: 03/01/1998</p>
<p>DUE: 09/01</p>
<p>INTEREST ACCRUES: 09/02/1997</p>
<p>ALL BONDS ARE PRICED AT PAR.</p>
<p> MATURITY		AMOUNT*    COUPON</p>
<p>09/01/1998		   65M    3.75  %</p>
<p>09/01/1999		   70M    3.90  %</p>
<p>09/01/2000		   70M    4.05  %</p>
<p>09/01/2001		   75M    4.15  %</p>
<p>09/01/2002		   75M    4.25  %</p>
<p>09/01/2003		   80M    4.35  %</p>
<p>09/01/2004		   85M    4.45  %</p>
<p>09/01/2005		   90M    4.55  %</p>
<p>09/01/2006		   90M    4.60  %</p>
<p>09/01/2007		   95M    4.65  %</p>
<p>09/01/2012		  550M    5.00  %</p>
<p>09/01/2016		  555M    5.10  %</p>
<p>CALL FEATURES: 09/01/2007    102.00</p>
<p>		   DTP 09/01/2009</p>
<p>* - APPROXIMATE SUBJECT TO CHANGE</p>
<p>The compliance addendum MSRB Rule G-11 will apply.</p>
<p>The award is expected Tuesday, August 19, 1997.</p>
<p>Delivery is expected on September 2, 1997.</p>
<p>This issue is book entry through DTC.</p>
<p>PaineWebber Incorporated</p>
<p>Leo Oppenheim &amp; Co., Inc.</p>
<p>Southwest Securities, Inc.</p>
<p>--Reuters Municipal Bond Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
